WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.037
Missing data can appear in several forms NULL is a
database null

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:13.327
Blank text is still a string value A sentinel such
as all zeros

00:00:13.354 --> 00:00:19.223
is an ordinary value unless the business rule says
it represents missingness The

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.928
word Unknown is also ordinary text unless its
meaning is documented Do

00:00:24.954 --> 00:00:29.243
not collapse these states automatically without
understanding the source convention
